        "TileImage": "$($repository 7a720096-f14b-434a-8d4b-59456ca68ee7).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, Master Bruce.\r\rAs you requested, I have located Catwoman, the Joker, Poison Evy and Mr. Freeze in the annual gathering of ACME, the world most powerful villains.\r\rWe have developed a new suit for you: Rave suit. The only way you won&#39;t be recognised will be not using a mask. But this is as good as your normal outfit.\r\rRemember your training: use the shadows, move unseen and use the ledges.\r\rGood luck,\r\rAlfred Pennyworth\r\r&lt;HCCE&gt;",
